  "description": "Time stands still for a small cabin in the forest.\n“Welcome, take a rest here.”\n\nIn the deep forest, there is a rest stop for travelers.\nA boy is looking after the place all alone. Knock. Knock.\n“Come in, please” At the kind response of the boy, a cat enters the rest stop and starts to spill out her story.\nKnock. Knock. Then a dog, a hamster and a parrot visit the rest stop one by one.\nAfter finishing each animals’ story, the boy opens a map to guide them. Where is the boy leading them to? What is left unsaid by animals?\n\nThis is a book to comfort someone who has ever had experience of losing companion animals.\n\n(Source: at noon books)",
